  "bodyHash": "a7c0e20c51dfa955",
  "content": "\n\n你好世界\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=X&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">《災厄入侵》將《我的世界》中的災厄村民提升至全新境界！近十種擁有獨特能力的新型災厄村民現在遊蕩在你的世界中。有些隱藏在危險的新建築中，有些則加入村莊襲擊，讓戰役更加艱難。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">對抗更聰明的敵人，尋找強大的戰利品，探索秘密地點。全新的挑戰意味著全新的獎勵——一路上充滿樂趣！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏹 新型災厄村民</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">鍊金術師</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：擅長射箭的專家，被激怒時會投擲滯留藥水。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📚 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">典藏員</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：用附魔為附近的災厄村民提供增益。受驚時會逃跑並施放法術。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">猛擊者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：手持盾牌的霸凌者，會直接衝撞玩家。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掠奪者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：遠程攻擊的災厄村民，會投擲致命的戰斧——從他身上取得「白金附魔戰斧」吧！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">挑釁者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：使用弓的災厄村民，具備基礎增益法術。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔮 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">法師</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：行蹤飄忽的施法者，召喚危險的紫色火焰。掉落「異樣塵埃」。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧟 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">死靈法師</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：不死生物的大師，利用召喚法術壓倒玩家。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">審判官</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：持有強力盾牌的強大災厄戰士——先打破他的盾牌才能擊敗他！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">呼火者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：看似無害的神秘法師——直到他釋放出毀滅性的魔法。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧙 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">召喚者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：最強大的災厄村民！掉落「聖潔寶珠」，可用於配合「附魔桌」升級附魔。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎭 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">幻術師</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：現已加入生存模式並擁有全新外觀！掉落「幻象塵埃」。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏰 新建築結構</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏠 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">呼火者小屋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：帶有農場的小型房屋。發現於惡地（Badlands）。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏰 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">災厄堡壘</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：帶有城牆、塔樓和強大災厄村民的防禦前哨站。發現於泰加林（Taiga）。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🗼 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">幻術師高塔</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：多層高塔，內部充滿災厄村民，頂部與幻術師對戰。發現於泰加林與黑森林。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧩 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">迷宮</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：龐大的地下迷宮，充滿大量戰利品與更多災厄村民。尋找石廟入口！發現於大多數森林生物群系。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛖 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">法師小屋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：小型房屋結構。發現於黑森林。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛠️ 新裝備與物品</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔔 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">附魔桌</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：突破常規限制升級附魔！每次使用需消耗一顆「聖潔寶珠」。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">白金附魔戰斧</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：類似戰斧的投擲武器，由掠奪者罕見掉落。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🕯️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">迷失蠟燭</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：透過顯示位置來幫助定位附近的礦脈。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">視覺之角</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：使附近怪物發光，讓你更快找到它們！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/5.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客戶端與伺服器皆必須安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（FABRIC &amp; NEOFORGE）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（FABRIC）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（FABRIC）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若模組支援配置，可直接透過遊戲內的模組選單進行設定（Fabric 版本需安裝由 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a> 開發的 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a>）。請注意，在較舊的《我的世界》版本中，還需安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config Screens</span></a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若需使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有檔案皆位於 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code> 資料夾內，依設定檔類型命名為 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code>、<code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code> 或 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code>。並非所有類型的設定檔都會存在，視模組而定。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">衷心感謝最初創作精彩災厄擴充模組的 <a href=\"https://github.com/OhDricky\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Dricky</span></a>。《災厄入侵》忠實延續了他們的作品，並加入了許多新功能、改進、重製與錯誤修正。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/ZekeSmith\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">ZekeSmith</span></a> 在原始碼被 Dricky 刪除後重新找到原版《災厄擴充》的程式碼，使得本移植版得以在 <a href=\"https://spdx.org/licenses/MIT.html\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MIT</span></a> 授權條款下實現。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/safrodev\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">safrodev</span></a> 致力於《災厄擴充》1.19.2 版本的開發，「視覺之角」的紋理即取材自此版本。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tamlighter\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Tamlighter</span></a> 創作了眾多精彩的新型紋理。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/diagonal-fences\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/better-animations-collection\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/betteranimationscollection/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/effect-descriptions\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectdescriptions/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
